{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12436","headline":"酬赵给事相寻不遇留赠 · 钱起","name":"酬赵给事相寻不遇留赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁忆颜生穷巷里，能劳马迹破春苔。\n忽看童子扫花处，始愧夕郎题凤来。\n斜景适随诗兴尽，好风才送佩声回。\n岂无鸡黍期他日，惜此残春阻绿杯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12436.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12436","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}